    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "MENU \u0026 WINE\nLIST\nCONNOISSEUR\nCLAS\nUJUNITED AIRLInES",
      "Cocktails and Apéritifs\nTanqueray Gin Martini\nSmirnoff Vodka Martini\nBloody Mary\nScrewdriver\nDry Sack Sherry\nCampari\nSpirits\nTanqueray Gin\nSmirnoff Vodka\nFinlandia Vodka\nChivas Regal Scotch Whisky\nGlenfiddich Single Malt Whisky\nJ.\u0026 B. Scotch Whisky\nJohnnie Walker Black Label Scotch Whisky\nJack Daniel's Tennessee Whiskey\nWild Turkey Bourbon\nCrown Royal Canadian Whisky\nBacardi Rum\nLiqueurs\nCourvoisier VSOP Cognac\nCockburn's Porto\nRemy Martin Cognac\nAmaretto di Saronno\nGrand Marnier\nDrambuie\nKahlúa\nBaileys Irish Cream\nBeer\nBudweiser\nMiller Lite\nRegional Beers\nWINE LIS\nH A\nChampagne is both a place and a method. The place is north of Paris. The method is what puts\nthe bubbles into still wine. The French will insist that Champagne can be made only in the place\nof that name: others think otherwise. It is a question for lawyers to decide. The French also will insist\nthat champagne from Champagne is inimitable. and that is less debatable.\nBRUT PREMIER\nRoederer Brut Premier\nLouis Roederer is one of the smaller export houses\nof Champagne, and one of the most famous. Deep\ngold hues hint at the riches Brut Premier delivers. A\nhigh proportion of Pinot Noir is part of the secret.\nFour years on the yeast is another.\nPECIAL\n•ECTION\nPorto is the wine of the Upper Douro region in Northern Portugal. It is fortified by the addition of grape\nbrandy which stops the fermentation and leaves behind residual sugar: retaining some of the sweetness.\nOnly the fortified wine from Portugal, and not its copies, can be designated Porto.\nCockburn's Special Reserve Porto\nIn this classic wood port, a faintly ambered.\nslightly pale ruby hue reveals the presence of aged\nblending stocks and a proportion of white grapes.\nincluded to provide rounded textures and mature\nflavors at bottling. Cockburn (pronounced Coe-\nburn) is one of many Port firms founded by Brit-\nons. hence the name.\nIMPORTED\nCOCKBURN'S\nSPECIAL RESERVE\nPORTO\nockburn Smither 4.Gl"
    ],
